# Not needed for normal use: `npm run dev` proxies /api/* to the backend
# (see vite.config.ts), and the packaged desktop build serves the frontend
# and API from the same origin. Only set this to point the frontend at a
# backend on a different host/port with no proxy in front of it.
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000
